{"about_the_game":"Zeo effect is a tactical-arcade with rogue-lite elements and global map and item accumulation.<br>Time runs only when you take action.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1686800/extras/653af8a3c06deb694519fbfab9a51240.poster.avif?t=1696785312\" width=500 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1686800/extras/653af8a3c06deb694519fbfab9a51240.webm?t=1696785312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1686800/extras/653af8a3c06deb694519fbfab9a51240.mp4?t=1696785312\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Extensive arsenal of assault, defensive and auxiliary instruments.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1686800/extras/e490a41efdb6c441e2c8eddb81eee446.poster.avif?t=1696785312\" width=600 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1686800/extras/e490a41efdb6c441e2c8eddb81eee446.webm?t=1696785312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1686800/extras/e490a41efdb6c441e2c8eddb81eee446.mp4?t=1696785312\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Your run consists of a ramified path, divided into segments which contain at least 3 points to choose from, that differ in duration, difficulty,<br>type of loot, or special conditions and restrictions for room completion.  <br><br>Getting hit by an enemy bullet spends a significant amount of drone's energy, which then goes to safe spaces and regenerates upon room completion.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1686800/extras/b71ffbf24508a5c713cd51bac3e47d83.poster.avif?t=1696785312\" width=464 height=414 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1686800/extras/b71ffbf24508a5c713cd51bac3e47d83.webm?t=1696785312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1686800/extras/b71ffbf24508a5c713cd51bac3e47d83.mp4?t=1696785312\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>A very valuable resource drops from destroyed enemies - spheres from which you can get additional weapons.<br><br>Every enemy possesses an individual behavior pattern<br>Enemies have blind zones and different alarm activation patterns.<br>The player can attack head on or sneak to the enemies' blind zones and calmly destroy them.<br>Some enemies are easier to battle in open spaces, with some it may be wiser to use cover.<br>Or you can just quickly defeat everybody in your way with smart use of items.<br><br>Your primary weapon is pretty powerful and is an effective tool to eliminate enemies. It is permanently at your disposal.<br>But there is a vast arsenal of tools, weapons and gadgets at your disposal, that will help destroying enemies faster, more effective, more spectacular and a lot more fun.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1686800/extras/5fc33efb930f86f26a09e677f42aa043.poster.avif?t=1696785312\" width=600 height=454 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1686800/extras/5fc33efb930f86f26a09e677f42aa043.webm?t=1696785312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1686800/extras/5fc33efb930f86f26a09e677f42aa043.mp4?t=1696785312\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackgrou